cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SPIDER, please cite it via the metadata in this file and
  the papers listed under references (Bower et al. 2018 for the interior
  dynamics; Wolf and Bower 2018 for the RTpress melt data; Bower et al.
  2019 for the volatile and atmosphere coupling; Bower et al. 2022 for
  the redox reactions).
title: 'SPIDER: Simulating Planetary Interior Dynamics with Extreme Rheology'
type: software
repository-code: 'https://github.com/FormingWorlds/SPIDER'
url: 'https://proteus-framework.org/SPIDER/'
license: GPL-3.0
